{"id":"anthicus","nameZh":"天灾","nameEn":"anthicus","star":"E","author":"UP","category":"机甲类-E","categoryLabel":"机甲（埃里克尔）","tier":3,"unitClass":"ErekirUnitType","isSubUnit":false,"packs":["UP的埃里克尔单位&建筑补丁整合包.hjson","UP的埃里克尔单位补丁包.hjson","UT和UP的S&E星单位补丁合集.hjson"],"description":"中型导弹牵引机甲。T3级机甲类单位，拥有中型装甲，可以跨越大多数地形，攻击方式为从后置导弹仓发射多枚远程追踪导弹，命中后分裂出对空拦截弹，同时搭载一台对空牵引光束，能将空中单位拉向自己并集火消灭。\n天灾的改造方案源于一个战术需求——我们缺乏一台能同时应对地面和空中威胁的机动单位，经过重新设计，天灾的导弹被赋予了全新的使命，专精于猎杀天空之上的敌方空军，本体新增的牵引光束则能将逃窜的空中目标拉回火力网中，被光束锁定的敌人几乎无法逃脱，配合导弹和拦截弹的集火，任何胆敢接近的空军都将被迅速摧毁。\n天灾的弱点在于对建筑破坏力较低，且导弹装填时间较长，但在混编部队中，它的区域压制和对空管制能力无可替代。","stats":{"health":2700.0,"armor":7.0,"speed":0.65,"hitSize":21.0,"range":null,"maxRange":425,"targetAir":true,"targetGround":true,"fogRadius":40.0,"payloadCapacity":null},"vanillaStats":{"health":2700.0,"armor":7.0,"speed":0.65,"hitSize":21.0,"range":null,"maxRange":null},"dps":{"direct":30.0,"splash":0.0,"total":30.0,"air":30.0,"ground":0.0,"targetAir":true,"targetGround":true},"vanillaDps":{"direct":0.0,"splash":0.0,"total":0.0,"air":0.0,"ground":0.0},"weapons":[{"name":"anthicus-weapon","weaponType":"Weapon","role":"damage","bulletType":"BulletType","mode":"burst","reload":110.0,"reloadSec":1.833,"reloadExplicit":true,"shots":3,"shotDelay":8.0,"firstShotDelay":0.0,"damage":0.0,"splashDamage":0.0,"splashDamageRadius":-1.0,"perShotDirect":0.0,"perShotSplash":0.0,"fragBullets":0,"fragDirect":0.0,"fragSplash":0.0,"dps":0.0,"perShot":0.0,"splashDps":null,"collidesAir":true,"collidesGround":true,"bulletRange":null,"continuous":false,"canHitAir":true,"canHitGround":true},{"name":"(未命名)","weaponType":"Weapon","role":"warhead","bulletType":"ExplosionBulletType","mode":"burst","reload":1.0,"reloadSec":0.017,"reloadExplicit":true,"shots":1,"shotDelay":0.0,"firstShotDelay":0.0,"damage":0.0,"splashDamage":140.0,"splashDamageRadius":25.0,"perShotDirect":0.0,"perShotSplash":140.0,"fragBullets":0,"fragDirect":0.0,"fragSplash":0.0,"dps":null,"perShot":0.0,"splashDps":null,"collidesAir":true,"collidesGround":true